  "script": "Meet the 2017 Audi TT RS, a sports car that blends luxury with punchy performance. This compact powerhouse pulls you in with its stylish design and aggressive stance. Under the hood, the TT RS boasts a turbocharged 2.5-liter, 5-cylinder engine. It's cranking out 400 horsepower, offering sheer exhilaration and a thrilling drive. The Quattro all-wheel drive system ensures superb traction and control. Whether you're on winding roads or track days, this car grips like a dream. Originally priced around $70,000, you can find one today for about $45,000. For a car with such prowess and luxury, that's a compelling deal. The TT RS isn't just about stock performance. With tuning, you can push this engine well beyond factory figures, giving enthusiasts plenty of room to play. So, is the 2017 Audi TT RS the right mix of luxury and performance for you? With its dynamic drive and enticing value, it might just be time to find out.",
